@startuml
title UML State Chart Diagram

[*] --> CreateAccount

state "Create Account" as CreateAccount
state Login <<choice>>
state RegistrationDecision <<choice>>
state InvalidRegistration as InvalidRegistration
state ValidLogin as ValidLogin
state LocationChoice <<choice>>
state InvalidLocation as InvalidLocation
state ValidLocation as ValidLocation
state CheckWeather <<choice>>
state WeatherDetails <<choice>>
state Logout

CreateAccount : entry / To Action
CreateAccount : do / Create account
CreateAccount : exit / Account created or not

InvalidRegistration : entry / Registration failed
InvalidRegistration : do / Show error message
InvalidRegistration : exit / Abnormal termination

ValidLogin : entry / User logged in
ValidLogin : do / Location selection
ValidLogin : exit / Location selected

LocationChoice : entry / To Action
LocationChoice : do / Select location
LocationChoice : exit / Location entered or not

InvalidLocation : entry / Invalid location
InvalidLocation : do / Show error message
InvalidLocation : exit / Abnormal termination

ValidLocation : entry / Valid location
ValidLocation : do / Check weather
ValidLocation : exit / Weather checked

CheckWeather : entry / To Action
CheckWeather : do / Select what to check (temperature, humidity, rainfall, pressure, or dew point)
CheckWeather : exit / What to check selected

WeatherDetails : entry / To Action
WeatherDetails : do / View additional weather details (alerts, a weekly analysis, a future prediction, or a graph)
WeatherDetails : exit / Details viewed

Logout : entry / User logged out
Logout : do / End session
Logout : exit / Session ended

CreateAccount --> Login
Login --> RegistrationDecision
RegistrationDecision --> InvalidRegistration
RegistrationDecision --> ValidLogin

ValidLogin --> LocationChoice
LocationChoice --> LocationChoice
LocationChoice --> InvalidLocation
LocationChoice --> ValidLocation

ValidLocation --> CheckWeather
CheckWeather --> WeatherDetails
WeatherDetails --> Logout

InvalidRegistration --> [*]
InvalidLocation --> [*]

@enduml
